@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Táctica 'Redundancy with Voting'
autonumber

' --- CONFIGURACIÓN VISUAL ---
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
}
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FEFECE
    BorderColor #D4D433
}

' --- PARTICIPANTES ---
actor "User" as User
participant "tarjetas-form.\ncomponent.ts" as Component
participant "Tarjeta.service.ts" as FrontService

' === BACKEND ===
participant "TarjetaController" as Controller
participant "TarjetaService" as BackService

' === TÁCTICA: VOTING MANAGER Y SUS VOTANTES ===
participant "FraudVotingManager" as Manager #LightGreen
participant "Internal\nVoter" as V1
participant "External\nVoter" as V2
participant "Heuristic\nVoter" as V3

' === PERSISTENCIA ===
participant "TarjetaRepository" as Repo
' CORRECCIÓN: Ahora es un participante (recuadro), no database
participant "Database\nMySQL" as DB

' =========================================================
' === FLUJO PRINCIPAL (REGISTRO EXITOSO) ===
' =========================================================

' 1. Inicio
User -> Component: Click Registrar
Component -> Component: Valida Form
Component -> FrontService: solicita registrar
FrontService -> Controller: POST /tarjetas
Controller -> BackService: Pasa solicitud (DTO)

' 2. Validación Inicial (BD)
BackService -> Repo: valida existencia
Repo -> DB: SELECT count(*)
DB --> Repo: 0 (No existe)
Repo --> BackService: OK, continuar

' ---------------------------------------------------------
' 3. APLICACIÓN DE LA TÁCTICA: VOTACIÓN
' ---------------------------------------------------------
BackService -> Manager: executeVoting(dto)
activate Manager

    note right of Manager
      **Redundancia Activa:**
      Consulta 3 fuentes distintas
      para enmascarar fallos.
    end note

    ' Votante 1: OK
    Manager -> V1: isSafe(dto)
    V1 --> Manager: true (Voto +)

    ' Votante 2: OK
    Manager -> V2: isSafe(dto)
    V2 --> Manager: true (Voto +)

    ' Votante 3: FALLO (Simulado)
    Manager -> V3: isSafe(dto)
    V3 --> Manager: false (Voto -)

    Manager -> Manager: Calcular: 2 vs 1
    note right of Manager
      **Decisión:** APROBADO
      (La mayoría gana)
    end note

Manager --> BackService: true (Es seguro)
deactivate Manager

' 4. Continuación del Registro (Solo si la votación pasó)
BackService -> BackService: Lógica de negocio\n(Crear Entidad)

BackService -> Repo: save(tarjeta)
Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO...
DB --> Repo: OK
Repo --> BackService: Tarjeta Guardada

BackService --> Controller: Retorna DTO Exitoso
Controller --> FrontService: 200 OK
FrontService --> Component: Confirmación
Component -> User: Muestra "Registro Exitoso"

' =========================================================
' === FLUJOS ALTERNOS (ERRORES) ===
' =========================================================

' --- 1. Fraude Confirmado (La votación falla) ---
group Flujo Alterno: Fraude Detectado (Mayoría Negativa)
    ' Nota: Asumimos que esto ocurre en la fase de votación
    BackService -> Manager: executeVoting(dto)
    activate Manager

    Manager -> V1: isSafe() --> false
    Manager -> V2: isSafe() --> true
    Manager -> V3: isSafe() --> false

    Manager -> Manager: Calcular: 1 vs 2
    note right of Manager
        **Decisión:** RECHAZADO
        (Posible Fraude)
    end note

    Manager --> BackService: false
    deactivate Manager

    BackService --> Controller: Lanza SecurityException
    Controller --> FrontService: 403 Forbidden
    FrontService --> Component: Error "Denegado por seguridad"
end

' --- 2. Error de Negocio ---
group Flujo Alterno: Código Duplicado
    Repo -> DB: SELECT
    DB --> Repo: 1 (Ya existe)
    Repo --> BackService: Error: Existe
    BackService --> Controller: Lanza BusinessException
    Controller --> FrontService: 400 Bad Request
end

@enduml